{
  "id": "1791536051066",
  "alias": "Pool Simple Solar and Filtration - Commissioning",
  "description": "COMMISSIONING: roof >=90F solar eligibility (5-minute solar-up trigger); 600 verified pump-running minutes per 08:00-08:00 accounting cycle. Midnight catchup can run as late as 8AM to finish 10h. Spa priority; only stop Pool when schedule owns it. PoolOS autonomy stays disabled. Reset at 8AM, re-evaluate roof. Pool running during solar-eligible conditions is re-adopted on the next minute tick, including external restart or return from Spa, so solar-down can stop it. MASTER AUTHORITY: Pool Automatic Ownership ON means schedule controls equipment regardless of external button use; OFF means no schedule equipment commands. Independent safety protections remain active. Midnight reconciles externally started pool sessions: adopt running Pool when filtration debt remains, start Pool only if off, and stop running Pool when quota already met. Maintenance mode blocks all actions. Heating preference: solar-start only for Solar/Eco Heat; solar-down only for Solar. Heating source selected by separate preference controller. Quota shutdown on tick is suppressed when solar roof >=90F so daytime solar heating continues after filtration goal. Dynamic filtration target based on pool water: <=70F 360min; <=80F 480min; <=85F 540min; <=90F 600min; >90F 720min; invalid 600min. No equipment sequences changed.",
